## 23. Suggested Frontend Architecture

- Prefer componentized page shells (hero / section / gallery / footer)
- Keep motion modules isolated: `preloader`, `heroTimeline`, `scrollSystem`, `interactions`
- Drive scroll-linked values from a single scroll progress source
- Feature-detect touch to disable cursor/magnetic layers

