## 25. Implementation Sequence

1. Tokens (color, type, spacing) from observed design system
2. Static layout / sections without motion
3. Preloader only if OBSERVED
4. Hero entrance timeline only if OBSERVED (not LAYOUT_CHANGE)
5. Scroll reveals / scrub / pin / parallax where OBSERVED
6. Hover / cursor / magnetic micro-interactions where OBSERVED
7. Page transitions where OBSERVED
8. Responsive simplification pass (compare desktop vs mobile evidence)

